Level 1: The Basics

Mission: Create a directory named Arena and then inside it, create three files: warrior.txt, mage.txt, and archer.txt. List the contents of the Arena directory.

This is a simple task with no script required. 

bench:~/DevOps/BattleBashArena# mkdir Arena
bench:~/DevOps/BattleBashArena# cd Arena/
bench:~/DevOps/BattleBashArena/Arena# touch warrior.txt | touch mage.txt | touch archer.txt
bench:~/DevOps/BattleBashArena/Arena# ls
archer.txt   mage.txt     warrior.txt
